        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions AP-CST1RDDRR, Reed Refrigerator Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Castle Appliance Pull is one of our all time favorite designs and it features the the classic reed style. It is packaged with mounting screws for a refrigerator / appliance door panel. We believe a refrigerator needs to have a 18\" or longer pull installed to effectively pull open todays large \"vacuum\" sealed doors such as the ones found on a Sub Zero refrigerator. This Castle Refrigerator Handle is available in 20 inch, 24 inch, and 30 inch lengths.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe also have available a <a href=\"/products/castle-door-pull-first-impressions-cst1rddrr\"><b>Castle Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions AP-CST1RDDRR Reed Refrigerator Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/cf833-8-detail-picture.jpg?v=1704354618\" target=\"new\"><b>FII-AP-CST1RDDRR Detailed View</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul> \r\n<b>AP-CST1020RDDRR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 20\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 13-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-CST1024RDDRR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 17-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-CST1030RDDRR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 23-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Castle Appliance Pull | Castle Refrigerator Handle",
                "description": "First Impressions Castle Appliance Pull is for refrigerators and freezers. It is available in 4 standard lengths of 18 inches, 20 inches, 24 inches, and 30 inches. Select this Castle Refrigerator Handle in wide array of finish colors including Oil Rubbed Bronze, Satin Nickel, and Antique Brass.",
